        <mxCell id="c75" value="&lt;i&gt;Selected: C48, whose formula shows in the bar. Outlined: the lowest error of the five methods in each column, Furniture 2.90%, Lighting 5.52%, Textiles 2.47%, Accessories 4.58%, Services 14.14%. Column A, the quarter index, is hidden, and the row above the heading, which names the error, is not shown. Row 48 chooses among the first three methods only, so for Furniture it differs from row 49.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="280" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
